Done! Updated `loadOrders` to accept an optional second argument `{ debug }`. When `debug` is true, it logs the number of orders loaded and the file path:

```javascript
export function loadOrders(path = DEFAULT_PATH, { debug } = {}) {
  const orders = JSON.parse(readFileSync(path, 'utf8'));
  if (debug) {
    log(`Loaded ${orders.length} orders from ${path}`);
  }
  return orders;
}
```
